                  "kind": "group",
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "kind": "strong",
                      "children": [
                        {
                          "kind": "text",
                          "value": "（1）算法基本设计思想"
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "kind": "group",
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "kind": "br",
                      "children": []
                    },
                    {
                      "kind": "text",
                      "value": "方法一：基于先序递归遍历。定义递归函数，将当前结点的深度作为参数传递。若结点为叶子结点，则累加 "
                    },
                    {
                      "kind": "code",
                      "value": "深度 * 权值",
                      "block": false,
                      "lang": "text"
                    },
                    {
                      "kind": "text",
                      "value": " 到结果；否则，递归遍历其左右子树，并将深度参数加1。"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "kind": "group",
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "kind": "br",
                      "children": []
                    },
                    {
                      "kind": "text",
                      "value": "方法二：基于层次遍历（BFS）。使用队列实现层次遍历，并记录当前层数 "
                    },
                    {
                      "kind": "code",
                      "value": "deep",
                      "block": false,
                      "lang": "text"
                    },
                    {
                      "kind": "text",
                      "value": "。利用指针 "
                    },
                    {
                      "kind": "code",
                      "value": "lastNode",
                      "block": false,
                      "lang": "text"
                    },
                    {
                      "kind": "text",
                      "value": " 标记当前层最后一个结点。当遍历到叶子结点时，累加 "
                    },
                    {
                      "kind": "code",
                      "value": "deep * 权值",
                      "block": false,
                      "lang": "text"
                    },
                    {
                      "kind": "text",
                      "value": "。每当处理完 "
                    },
                    {
                      "kind": "code",
                      "value": "lastNode",
                      "block": false,
                      "lang": "text"
                    },
                    {
                      "kind": "text",
                      "value": " 结点，就更新 "
                    },
                    {
                      "kind": "code",
                      "value": "lastNode",
                      "block": false,
                      "lang": "text"
                    },
                    {
                      "kind": "text",
                      "value": " 为下一层的最后一个结点，并将 "
                    },
                    {
                      "kind": "code",
                      "value": "deep",
                      "block": false,
                      "lang": "text"
                    },
                    {
                      "kind": "text",
                      "value": " 加1。"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "kind": "p",
              "children": [
                {
                  "kind": "group",
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "kind": "strong",
                      "children": [
                        {
                          "kind": "text",
                          "value": "（2）二叉树结点的数据类型定义（C语言）"
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "kind": "code",
              "value": "typedef struct BiTNode {\n    int weight;                     // 存储权值\n    struct BiTNode *lchild, *rchild; // 左、右孩子指针\n} BiTNode, *BiTree;",
              "block": true,
              "lang": "c"
            },
            {
              "kind": "p",
              "children": [
                {
                  "kind": "group",
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "kind": "strong",
                      "children": [
                        {
                          "kind": "text",
                          "value": "（3）算法描述（C语言）"
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "kind": "group",
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "kind": "br",
                      "children": []
                    },
                    {
                      "kind": "strong",
                      "children": [
                        {
                          "kind": "text",
                          "value": "方法一：先序递归"
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "kind": "code",
              "value": "int wpl_PreOrder(BiTree root, int deep);\nint wpl_LevelOrder(BiTree root);\n\nint WPL(BiTree root) {\n    return wpl_PreOrder(root, 0); // 基于先序遍历\n    // 如需使用层次遍历，可改为：return wpl_LevelOrder(root);\n}\n\nint wpl_PreOrder(BiTree root, int deep) {\n    if (root == NULL) return 0; // 空树返回0\n    if (root->lchild == NULL && root->rchild == NULL)\n        return deep * root->weight;\n    return wpl_PreOrder(root->lchild, deep + 1)\n         + wpl_PreOrder(root->rchild, deep + 1);\n}",
              "block": true,
              "lang": "c"
            },
            {
              "kind": "p",
              "children": [
                {
                  "kind": "group",
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "kind": "strong",
                      "children": [
                        {
                          "kind": "text",
                          "value": "方法二：层次遍历"
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "kind": "code",
              "value": "int wpl_LevelOrder(BiTree root) {\n    if (root == NULL) return 0;\n    // MaxSize不小于树中结点数\n    BiTree q[MaxSize]; // 声明队列，end1为头指针，end2为尾指针\n    int end1, end2 = 0;\n    end1 = end2 = 0;\n    int wpl = 0, deep = 0;\n    BiTree lastNode;\n    BiTree newlastNode;\n    lastNode = root;\n    newlastNode = NULL;\n    q[end2++] = root;\n    while (end1 != end2) {\n        BiTree t = q[end1++];\n        if (t->lchild == NULL && t->rchild == NULL) {\n            wpl += deep * t->weight;\n        }\n        if (t->lchild != NULL) {\n            q[end2++] = t->lchild;\n            newlastNode = t->lchild;\n        }\n        if (t->rchild != NULL) {\n            q[end2++] = t->rchild;\n            newlastNode = t->rchild;\n        }\n        if (t == lastNode) {\n            lastNode = newlastNode;\n            deep += 1;\n        }\n    }\n    return wpl; // 返回wpl\n}",
              "block": true,
              "lang": "c"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
